<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>The War Room | Secure Communication Terminal</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Stardos+Stencil:wght@400;700&family=Special+Elite&family=Courier+Prime:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #1a1a1a;
            --terminal-green: #4b5320;
            --text-gold: #c5beb1;
            --stencil-red: #9e1b1b;
            --paper-white: #e8e4d9;
            --glow: 0 0 10px rgba(75, 83, 32, 0.5);
            --texture: url("https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/carbon-fibre.png");
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            background-image: var(--texture);
            color: var(--text-gold);
            font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;
            line-height: 1.4;
            padding: 20px;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .terminal-container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border: 2px solid var(--terminal-green);
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
            box-shadow: var(--glow);
            padding: 20px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .terminal-container::before {
            content: " ";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0; right: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(18, 16, 16, 0) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 50%), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.03), rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.01), rgba(0, 0, 255, 0.03));
            background-size: 100% 4px, 3px 100%;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        header {
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--terminal-green);
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-family: 'Stardos Stencil', cursive;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            color: var(--terminal-green);
            text-shadow: var(--glow);
        }

        .status-bar {
            text-align: right;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--terminal-green);
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
            gap: 40px;
        }

        h2 {
            font-family: 'Stardos Stencil', cursive;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: var(--paper-white);
            border-left: 5px solid var(--stencil-red);
            padding-left: 15px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        /* SITREP Section */
        .sitrep-feed {
            height: 500px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding-right: 15px;
        }

        .sitrep-item {
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(75, 83, 32, 0.3);
            padding: 15px 0;
            animation: flicker 5s infinite;
        }

        .sitrep-meta {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--stencil-red);
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            display: block;
        }

        .sitrep-content {
            font-family: 'Special Elite', cursive;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        /* Submit Intel Form */
        .intel-form {
            background: rgba(75, 83, 32, 0.1);
            padding: 30px;
            border: 1px solid var(--terminal-green);
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            color: var(--terminal-green);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        input, textarea {
            width: 100%;
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--terminal-green);
            padding: 10px;
            color: var(--paper-white);
            font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;
            outline: none;
        }

        input:focus, textarea:focus {
            box-shadow: var(--glow);
        }

        .submit-btn {
            background: var(--stencil-red);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            font-family: 'Stardos Stencil', cursive;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            width: 100%;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .submit-btn:hover {
            background: white;
            color: var(--stencil-red);
        }

        .stamp {
            display: inline-block;
            border: 2px solid var(--stencil-red);
            color: var(--stencil-red);
            padding: 2px 10px;
            font-family: 'Stardos Stencil', cursive;
            transform: rotate(-5deg);
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        @keyframes flicker {
            0% { opacity: 1; }
            5% { opacity: 0.9; }
            10% { opacity: 1; }
            15% { opacity: 0.95; }
            25% { opacity: 1; }
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 5px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: var(--terminal-green);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .sitrep-feed { height: 300px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="terminal-container">
        <header>
            <div class="logo">WAR ROOM // COMM-LINK</div>
            <div class="status-bar">
                ENCRYPTION: AES-256 <br>
                CONNECTION: SECURE [STABLE] <br>
                LOC: [REDACTED]
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="grid">
            <section class="sitreps">
                <h2>Active Sitreps</h2>
                <div class="sitrep-feed">
                    <div class="sitrep-item">
                        <span class="sitrep-meta">08 NOV 23 // 1422 HRS</span>
                        <p class="sitrep-content">The newsletter is now live on the dark web mirrors. Verification successful. No casualties reported in the comment section... yet.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sitrep-item">
                        <span class="sitrep-meta">07 NOV 23 // 0900 HRS</span>
                        <p class="sitrep-content">Logistics update: Coffee supply chain restored. Operations back to 100% capacity. The "PowerPoint Warfare" dispatch is trending with the disgruntled colonel crowd.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sitrep-item">
                        <span class="sitrep-meta">05 NOV 23 // 2315 HRS</span>
                        <p class="sitrep-content">Strategic Middle Finger technique deployed against corporate HR memo. Immediate results observed: confusion and fear. Mission success.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sitrep-item" style="border: none;">
                        <span class="sitrep-meta">01 NOV 23 // 1200 HRS</span>
                        <p class="sitrep-content">System initialization. Terminal online. Eyes open, mouths shut, ears to the ground.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="contact">
                <h2>Submit Intel</h2>
                <div class="intel-form">
                    <form action="#" method="POST">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>Source Identifier (Name/Alias)</label>
                            <input type="text" placeholder="GHOST_RIDER_99" required>
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>Secure Response Channel (Email)</label>
                            <input type="email" placeholder="ENCRYPTED_ID@SECURE.NET" required>
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>Subject Classification</label>
                            <input type="text" placeholder="LEADERSHIP FAILURE / RANT / SUGGESTION">
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>Intel Payload (Message Content)</label>
                            <textarea rows="6" placeholder="TYPE YOUR MESSAGE HERE. AVOID SENSITIVE COORDINATES..."></textarea>
                        </div>
                        <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">TRANSMIT ENCRYPTED DATA</button>
                    </form>
                    <div class="stamp">DIRECT LINE TO COMMAND</div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--terminal-green); opacity: 0.5; font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace;">
        WARNING: ALL COMMUNICATIONS ARE LOGGED. UNAUTHORIZED ACCESS TO THE WAR ROOM IS PUNISHABLE BY 1,000 PUSHUPS.
    </div>

</body>
</html>